WEBVTT

00:00:00.133 --> 00:00:02.400
Are you a SMART fella,

00:00:02.400 --> 00:00:04.200
or a FART smella?

00:00:04.200 --> 00:00:05.567
Let's find OUT!

00:00:06.100 --> 00:00:06.633
Alright,

00:00:06.633 --> 00:00:08.300
a word analogy!

00:00:08.300 --> 00:00:10.500
Lion is to roar,

00:00:10.500 --> 00:00:12.667
as snake is to...

00:00:12.667 --> 00:00:13.233
what?

00:00:13.233 --> 00:00:13.767
A.

00:00:13.767 --> 00:00:14.333
Bite,

00:00:14.333 --> 00:00:14.867
B.

00:00:14.867 --> 00:00:15.400
Slither,

00:00:15.400 --> 00:00:15.967
C.

00:00:15.967 --> 00:00:16.500
Scale,

00:00:16.500 --> 00:00:17.600
or D.

00:00:17.600 --> 00:00:18.167
Hiss?

00:00:18.167 --> 00:00:19.267
Five seconds!

00:00:24.633 --> 00:00:25.700
TIME'S UP!

00:00:26.133 --> 00:00:26.700
It's...

00:00:26.700 --> 00:00:27.267
D,

00:00:27.267 --> 00:00:27.833
hiss!

00:00:27.833 --> 00:00:30.133
A lion says roar,

00:00:30.133 --> 00:00:33.000
so a snake says hiss.

00:00:33.500 --> 00:00:34.000
Okay,

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:35.433
a picture puzzle!

00:00:35.433 --> 00:00:38.333
Where does the dot move next?

00:00:38.333 --> 00:00:38.833
A.

00:00:38.833 --> 00:00:39.300
Bottom-right,

00:00:39.300 --> 00:00:39.800
B.

00:00:39.800 --> 00:00:40.267
Bottom-left,

00:00:40.267 --> 00:00:40.767
C.

00:00:40.767 --> 00:00:41.233
Top-right,

00:00:41.233 --> 00:00:42.200
or D.

00:00:42.200 --> 00:00:42.700
Top-left?

00:00:42.700 --> 00:00:43.667
Five seconds!

00:00:49.033 --> 00:00:50.100
TIME'S UP!

00:00:50.533 --> 00:00:51.667
The answer is...

00:00:51.667 --> 00:00:52.067
C,

00:00:52.067 --> 00:00:52.433
top-right!

00:00:52.433 --> 00:00:54.367
The dot steps clockwise around

00:00:54.367 --> 00:00:55.100
the corners,

00:00:55.100 --> 00:00:57.400
so the next spot is top-right.

00:00:57.933 --> 00:00:58.500
Alright,

00:00:58.500 --> 00:01:00.167
a number analogy!

00:01:00.167 --> 00:01:01.833
Three makes eight,

00:01:01.833 --> 00:01:03.500
four makes ten,

00:01:03.500 --> 00:01:05.167
seven makes sixteen,

00:01:05.167 --> 00:01:06.833
so eight makes...

00:01:06.833 --> 00:01:07.400
what?

00:01:07.400 --> 00:01:07.933
A.

00:01:07.933 --> 00:01:08.500
Eighteen,

00:01:08.500 --> 00:01:09.067
B.

00:01:09.067 --> 00:01:09.633
Nineteen,

00:01:09.633 --> 00:01:10.167
C.

00:01:10.167 --> 00:01:10.733
Sixteen,

00:01:10.733 --> 00:01:11.833
or D.

00:01:11.833 --> 00:01:12.400
Twenty?

00:01:12.400 --> 00:01:13.500
Five seconds!

00:01:18.900 --> 00:01:19.967
TIME'S UP!

00:01:20.400 --> 00:01:20.933
It's...

00:01:20.933 --> 00:01:21.433
A,

00:01:21.433 --> 00:01:21.967
eighteen!

00:01:21.967 --> 00:01:25.100
Each number is multiplied by two

00:01:25.100 --> 00:01:26.667
then add two,

00:01:26.667 --> 00:01:28.767
so eight becomes eighteen.

00:01:29.300 --> 00:01:29.667
So,

00:01:29.667 --> 00:01:31.467
are you smart or fart?

00:01:31.467 --> 00:01:33.667
Count up your correct answers to

00:01:33.667 --> 00:01:34.733
find your rank!

00:01:35.267 --> 00:01:35.567
So,

00:01:35.567 --> 00:01:36.800
how did you do?

00:01:36.800 --> 00:01:38.033
Comment your score below,

00:01:38.033 --> 00:01:39.267
and follow for more!
